WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:08.150
The new morning we've finally found

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:08.150
Yatto mitsuketa atarashii asa wa

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.190
is being hampered by the past.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.190
Tsukihi ga jama wo suru

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:17.660
What we chased after wasn't the future,

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:17.660
Mukau saki wa tsugi ja nakute

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.490
but the past so full of remorse.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.490
Sugi bakari oikaketa

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.960
The ruthless memories won't stop playing;

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.960
Nariyamanai yousha nai omoide tachi wa

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.050
they won't be forgiving us for a long time.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.050
Yurushite kuresou nimonai

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.890
It's about now that a teardrop

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.890
Sorosoro kana tesaguri tsukareta hoho wo

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.560
beings to roll down my fatigued cheeks.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.560
Kattou ga koboreochiru

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.810
Will this rain ever stop?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.810
Ame wa itsuka yamunodeshouka

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:53.030
I've been freezing for a long time.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:53.030
Zuibun nagai aida tsumetai

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.320
Why does the rain continue to fix on me?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.320
Ame wa doushite boku wo erabuno

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.080
I wonder if it could embrace me.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.080
Tsutsumarete iikana

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.870
Today, the rain falls again;

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.870
Ame wa yamu koto wo shirazuni

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:13.090
endlessly it falls knowing no end.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:13.090
Kyou mo furitsuzukukeredo

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.130
We nestle close to each other to share the warmth

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.130
Sotto sashidashita kasa no naka de

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:29.850
under this umbrella, you gently held out to me.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:29.850
Nukumori ni yorisoinagara

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.150
Colonel...

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:41.410
There's no need... for you to perform human transmutation.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.200
You'll do it, won't you, Mustang?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.760
Now!

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.440
I will.

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.610
Oh, so you'll do it?!

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.440
I'll do as you say, Lieutenant.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.110
I will not perform human transmutation!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.370
You're going to abandon her? That's not very nice of you.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.000
Abandon?

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:32.130
That's the last word I want to hear from someone who uses these guys as pawns.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:36.500
I'm sure they're happy to be my pawns.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:41.590
They were abandoned by their parents and would have died long ago if it hadn't been for me.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:46.310
Yet, I gave them food and the highest education possible.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.770
I also gave them the meaning to live.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.270
They're thankful.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.940
And this is precisely why you get tripped up by your enemy.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:57.860
What are you-

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.870
He disappeared?

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.890
Lost Light

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.890
Lost Light

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.000
Well, I'm  thankful at least.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.300
I was able to capture you thanks to your stupidity.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.420
L-Let go!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.090
Hurry up and let everyone go!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.890
Or else...!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:32.810
I-I'm the only doctor here who can use alchemy!

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:36.360
If you kill me, that woman is as good as dead!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.020
Don't you get it?!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.570
You're sounding pretty darn lame right now, Mister Doctor.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.540
A philosopher's stone...

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:00.800
Get the fuck out of my way!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.220
Lieutenant!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.640
Hang in there!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.350
Lieutenant! Open your eyes!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.810
Lieutenant...

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.730
Lieutenant...!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.770
Lieutenant!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:20.480
You all right?!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.830
If I can just reach that...

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.700
Don't die!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.250
Get yourself together, Lieutenant!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.010
This is more important!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.970
Leave this to me.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.270
Lieutenant!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.150
I've stopped the bleeding.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.520
You need to let her see a doctor right away.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.480
I'm in your debt. Thank you.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.660
I'm sorry, Colonel...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.700
Don't speak. Just rest for now.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:20.380
Thanks for understanding my glance.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.920
We've known each other for a while, after all.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:29.090
Furthermore, you were glaring at me as if you were trying to say,

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.510
"I'll shoot you to death if you perform human transmutation."

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.140
That was the last of them, eh?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.980
Thanks, guys.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:41.900
You saved us.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.280
Don't worry about it, man.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.690
Right! The philosopher's stone!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.080
King Bradley.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.670
His wounds aren't healing...?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.470
Long time no see, Mustang.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.720
It certainly has been a while.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:20.850
You look awfully different from how I remember.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.480
Bradley, eat this!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:15.240
I was certain you'd attempt human transmutation...

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.950
if someone precious were to fall right in front of your eyes.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.130
You're right, I probably would have back then.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:31.260
But now, I have people by my side who are willing to stop me and point me toward the right path.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:39.390
When you start thinking that humans are pitiful creatures that never learn,

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:45.310
there are those like you who knock us off our feet by learning and evolving at such a quick pace.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.020
Humans are just...

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.280
...so unpredictable, it infuriates me.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.200
What's the matter?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.710
He's right underneath...

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.460
Deep below.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.840
Damn you!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.880
I won't allow you to get in his way!

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.970
Give it up, old man.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.260
You're already-

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:18.850
Jerso!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.180
Pull yourself together!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.100
G-Get yourselves out of here...!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.360
Shit.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.280
Something truly fearsome is approaching.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.150
Look after the lieutenant for me.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.330
Colonel!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.710
A-Attaboy, Bradley.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.510
I sure am skilled at raising-

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.450
Colonel Mustang, you're the fifth sacrifice.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.410
The fifth and last.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.380
Again?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.170
Why the heck is it so rowdy today?

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.350
Ah, the solar eclipse has begun.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.740
I didn't really want to have to use this method,

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.990
but we're fairly short on time right now.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:48.660
We're going to force you to open the gate, Colonel Mustang.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.330
I certainly won't perform-

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.790
It doesn't matter whether you're willing to or not.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:59.090
An alchemist possessing the knowledge of human transmutation was assimilated by Pride.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.100
He has the construction formula.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.810
I've secured him.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.430
Step aside, Wrath.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:25.700
Well, I'm curious as to what they're going to take from you.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.290
Colonel!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.710
No! You'll be dragged into it!

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.540
Colonel!!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.860
The transmutation is complete.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.150
That's the four-eyed geezer?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:00.990
Where is the Colonel?

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.070
Worry not.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.530
He should be with our father by now.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.790
Though I certainly can't guarantee that he is with no physical defects.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:18.250
As you can see, I'm fatally wounded.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:26.260
Who shall be the one to win fame for defeating the Führer President of Amestris?

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.760
Will it be a chimera?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.260
A foreigner?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.520
Mustang's pet?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:36.060
Or perhaps, will all of you band together to take me down?

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.190
What the hell...?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.690
Why do I get the feeling we won't stand a chance against one wounded old man?

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:44.820
Underneath...

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.200
Right beneath that hole.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:53.120
The four-eyed geezer went nuts as soon as May said there's someone underneath that place.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.540
Said something about not letting us get in his way.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.040
Seems like they don't want us going further underground.

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.920
So that must be the center.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:02.670
That's right.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.760
I feel a huge cluster of energy right below us.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.430
If that's the case...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.300
Colonel!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.260
He's the fifth sacrifice, father.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:57.520
I'd like to say that we've gathered all five,

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.220
Are you all right, Colonel?!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.270
Colonel!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.230
Get yourself together, Colonel!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.520
but Alphonse Elric has yet to come over to this side.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.690
Are you okay, Colonel?!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.280
Fullmetal...?

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.410
Where the hell are we?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.910
We're with the big cheese now.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.910
What in the world happened, Colonel?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:23.040
I was thrown in front of a large gate in some white room...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.300
Gate?!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.960
Don't tell me they took something from you?!

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.430
But you still have all your limbs...

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:35.640
I'm surprised you can see me when it's so pitch-dark out here, Fullmetal.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.220
What are you talking-

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:42.400
It's too dark for me to see anything.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.280
The light.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.110
Where's the light?

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.290
I-It couldn't be...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.580
So you've lost your vision.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.500
How convenient.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:12.640
Truth be told, you have the most troublesome ability out of all the state alchemists,

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.180
so I'd much rather you sit there and weep.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.640
Colonel...

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.310
You performed human transmutation...?

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.770
Fullmetal.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.690
Do you really think I'd do something like that?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.450
We forcefully had him open the gate.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.370
But the result is all that matters.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.500
Though Colonel Mustang would have been the most troublesome opponent,

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.340
with this, he's utterly useless in battle.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.920
Truth is cruel.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:57.260
Out of the cocky ones who tried to revive the dead in order to be embraced by their mother's warmth again,

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:02.060
one of them was robbed of his leg with which to stand, and his one and only brother was also taken from him.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:08.070
The other was stripped of his entire body which left him unable to feel warmth at all.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:14.360
The woman who longed for her dead child was given a body no longer able to reproduce.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:19.830
Now, the one who had his eyes fixed on the country's future was robbed of his vision;

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.120
never again will he be able to see what the future holds.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.710
He gives humans their suitable forms of despair to prevent them from getting too conceited.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:33.590
He is the existence which you humans refer to as 'God'.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.220
Truth.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:41.560
How is that fair?!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:48.150
Those of us who acted on our own initiative certainly deserved it.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:55.490
But someone who wasn't even willing was dragged into human transmutation, robbed of his vision,

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.490
and you say that's well-deserved?

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.580
Truth is too illogical for me to accept!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.050
Are you planning on getting in father's way?

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.620
What is your true name?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.330
I have no name.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.500
I've disposed of it.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.460
What a coincidence.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.670
I, too, do not know my real name.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.640
A duel to the death between two nameless beings shall make quite a show.

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.210
May!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.590
There he is.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:39.340
How dare she open up a hole on the roof of my house...

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:43.100
He looks different now, but judging from that aura...!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.390
You're the immortal leader, aren't you?!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.140
Sir Alphonse?!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.520
What happened to you?!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.770
I don't know.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.100
He just won't wake up.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:52.980
No way!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.230
Sir Alphonse! Sir Alphonse!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.490
Please, wake up!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.490
Sir Alphonse!!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.170
It's...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.590
It's... my body...

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.650
I've been waiting for you.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:42.700
Welcome back.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.840
What's with this thin arm?

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.510
I'm skin and bone.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.430
I'm barely able to stand.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.260
I...

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.180
There's...!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.690
There's no way I'll be able to fight with that body!

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.150
Everyone's giving their all!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.940
You don't want to reunite with me?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.320
Of course I do!

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:27.950
I've... I've always dreamed of getting my body back!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.990
But...

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.000
Not now.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.630
I won't be able to fight with that body!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.380
Not with that body...

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.090
Do you want to go back to the other side?

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.220
Would you like to go back with that body?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.390
If so, I won't stop you.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.680
Sorry.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.930
I'll come again.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.310
Hang in there for a little longer!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.350
I'll definitely come again!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:38.270
I swear! It's a promise!

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:44.610
Al!

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:47.780
You okay, Al?!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:48.860
Sir Alphonse!

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:49.450
Al!

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.450
Master.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.580
Brother.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:54.660
May!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.700
Wait, where am-

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:02.090
In order to help your friends,

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:05.340
you leave behind the body you've been longing after for years.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.260
My soul, you are beyond dignified.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:11.430
I am nothing but proud to be your container.

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:20.020
But the fact that you went back may lead to the world being submerged in despair,

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.520
Alphonse.

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.730
That...

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:27.780
...makes all five of you.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.800
Ever since that day passed,

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.800
Ano hi kara zutto

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.050
I promised myself that I'd never cry.

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.050
Nakanaito kimetekitakedo

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.600
But even while I hoarded up the pain,

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.600
Itami wo kasanetemo

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:57.710
there was something I couldn't forgive myself for.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:57.710
Nanika wo yurusezu ni ita

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.150
I'll never be able

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.150
Mou modorenai

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.650
to return to those days.

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.650
Ikutsumo no hibi

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:08.740
I'm still powerless.

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:08.740
Boku wa mada nanimo dekizuni

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:13.990
I watch as the shards of memories disappear, one by one;

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:13.990
Kimi no ita kioku no kakera

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:19.860
memories of when you were still with me.

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:19.860
Mata hitotsu kieteyuku

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.880
I long to become

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.880
Kyou yori motto

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.630
stronger than I am now,

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.630
Tsuyoku naritai

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.770
so that my voice will eventually reach you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.770
Kono koe ga itsuka todokuyouni

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.140
If the wind happens to stop

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.140
Arukitsuzukete

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.850
in the midst of my long journey,

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.850
Kaze ga yandara

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:40.560
I'll look up at the sky in search of you.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:40.560
Kimi wo sagashite sora miageruyo

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:47.900
Beyond the daybreak, a ray of light breaks free.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:47.900
Yoake no saki ni hikari ga sasuyo

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:53.450
A rainbow spans across the sky.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:53.450
Niji ga kakaruyo

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:04.710
Courage is brought into submission by force,

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:08.000
and happiness is shattered to pieces.

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:13.680
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:19.680
Episode 60, Eye of Heaven, Gateway of Earth.

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:19.700
Eye of Heaven, 
Gateway of Earth

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:24.940
The world became engulfed in darkness.
